<title>UK: Banca Italease ups 150 bln lire three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Banca Italease ups 150 bln lire three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue announced earlier has been increased, lead manager IMI Sigeco Sim said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCA ITALEASE</p>
<p> AMT   *160 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-BOT    MATURITY    02.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE DOMESTIC FRN    MARGIN     +30 BP    PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> REOFFER    PAR	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LISTING    MILAN     SALE LIMITS ITALY    GOV LAW     ITALY</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBJECT TO BANK OF ITALY APPROVAL.</p>
<p>	     *LAUNCHED EARLIER FOR 150 BILLION LIRE AND NOW</p>
<p>		INCREASED BY 10 BILLION LIRE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
